<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Seven Network retrenches 43 staff.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Seven Network retrenches 43 staff.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Television broadcaster The Seven Network Ltd said on Thursday it had retrenched 43 staff in an effort to streamline areas of the company and concentrate resources on screen.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe these changes are necessary for the long term productivity of a healthy network,&quot; Seven managing director Gary Rice said in a statement.</p>
<p>Seven said the retrenchments, from Sydney, Melbourne and Perth, represented less than one percent of total staff numbers. Seven's shares closed unchanged at A$3.90 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
